00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:16.224
and we’re gonna play NBA 2K on
Google’s new gaming platform, Stadia,

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:18.309
where you can game anywhere, anytime.

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:19.269
Let’s go meet up with KAT.

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:20.770
- What up, bro?
- What’s up, KAT?

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.106
Thanks for comin’ to bowl with me.
- Absolutely.

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:23.982
- Here’s your controller.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:25.692
- Which one? That one?
- Yes, sir. 

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:26.109
- OK.

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:28.570
- I already plugged in the Chromecast.
They got Wi-Fi, so we’re good to go.

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:29.696
- Oh, we lit.
- Yeah, bro.

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:33.658
Before we get to the lanes,
let’s play some 2K and then—

00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:36.953
I’mma beat you in this, and then I’mma beat you on that.
- Psh, I don’t know about that, but we’ll see.

00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:37.912
- What team you gonna use?

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:40.749
- With the cameras around, I guess I’ll pick Minnesota.
- You gonna pick yourself? All right.

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:44.127
- How do you change uniforms? You hit Y?
- You wanna change uniforms? Yeah, hit Y.

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:46.838
- Oooh, OK!
- Yeah.

00:00:47.464 --> 00:00:48.465
All right, let’s get it.

00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:50.717
You still rockin’ the sleeve?

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:52.802
- I used to. I had a elbow thing—
- Uh-huh.

00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:56.765
- So I was, like, rockin’ it to protect it,
but I think it do look swaggy.

00:00:56.765 --> 00:00:57.974
Oh, got ‘em.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:00:59.851
- That’s how you start it?
- No, I thought—

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:03.730
- What do you usually do, you know,
on your days off to unwind?

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:07.192
- Wow. Uh, usually, I like bowling with friends, but

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:09.611
I always like, you know, just, really, playin’ video games.

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:11.404
You know, golfing, just really doin’—

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.865
- Golf?!
- Yeah, I love golfing, man.

00:01:13.865 --> 00:01:15.950
- How’s all the traveling been treating you?

00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:22.082
- That’s probably the most challenging thing that has
been for me in the NBA is just the travel. It’s nonstop.

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.541
- What do you do to keep up with it?

00:01:23.541 --> 00:01:25.835
- Hope to God my phone works.

00:01:26.377 --> 00:01:29.339
I ain’t gonna lie, these graphics is crazy.
- Clean, right?

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:30.924
And the greatest thing about it too—

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:33.343
- Wow!
- You can game anywhere as long as you got Wi-Fi.

00:01:33.343 --> 00:01:34.844
- I know, and that’s crazy.

00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:39.265
Cuz if you told me I could just have this and I don’t need
anything else, that saves a lotta space in the luggage.

00:01:39.808 --> 00:01:41.851
- Nooo.
- Oh, my God!

00:01:41.851 --> 00:01:43.770
- No!
- Oh! Come in, Karl!

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:44.729
Goddamn!

00:01:45.855 --> 00:01:47.941
- Nooo.
- Sheesh.

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:52.112
As long as 32’s on the court, I feel pretty
confident in my, in my ability to win.

00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:56.282
- What’s, like, the one thing that, I guess,
you were kinda skeptical about with Stadia that

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:58.493
you see is, you know, this is the real deal?

00:01:58.493 --> 00:01:59.994
- It’s the graphics more.
- Mhm.

00:01:59.994 --> 00:02:05.500
- I feel like it was more the graphics cuz I knew with
my gaming experience—like, PC, but I didn’t know, like,

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:07.919
could it really pull it off?
- Yeah, for sure.

00:02:07.919 --> 00:02:09.170
- And, like, it really does.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:12.757
I’m a guy who’s been playin’ console controller
for years and just to see, like,

00:02:12.757 --> 00:02:15.510
the controller itself is actually very nice to have.

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:18.805
