after we finish bowling, but—

00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:20.598
Oooh, sauce him up!

00:02:21.182 --> 00:02:22.642
But this is literally just beginning, man.

00:02:24.352 --> 00:02:26.813
Thank you!
- That was a good move, Will!

00:02:27.397 --> 00:02:27.939
- Let’s bowl some.

00:02:29.065 --> 00:02:29.941
Oh, sh—

00:02:31.234 --> 00:02:32.235
- There you go.

00:02:32.944 --> 00:02:33.862
- See what I’m workin’ with?

00:02:36.906 --> 00:02:38.366
