00:03:13.276 --> 00:03:16.446
You have the ball. YOU have the ball. You’re not—
you’re in the backcourt, though. Press A. 

00:03:17.238 --> 00:03:20.575
Pass it up, pass it—this man just shot a full-court shot! 
